;; Product dependency policy for check-dependencies (root dependency-checker.edn).
;; Analyst authors this from the theme module map before handoff.
;; Components are second namespace segments (keywords). Values = allowed deps.
;;
;; Dependency Rule: outer (UI/IO) may depend on process/domain; process must not
;; depend on UI, concrete IO, or adapters. Prefer real components from the map —
;; not a two-node :main/:process stub unless the theme truly has only those.
;;
;; Example for a tiny greeting theme:
;; {:allowed-dependencies {:greeting []
;;                         :ui [:greeting]}
;;  :fail-on-cycles true
;;  :fail-on-violations true}

{:allowed-dependencies {;; :process-or-domain-component []
                        ;; :ui [:process-or-domain-component]
                        }
 :fail-on-cycles true
 :fail-on-violations true}
